
  # Dashboard and Meal Tracker

  A responsive dashboard for tracking health metrics and nutrition intake -- designed to help users monitor daily intake and spot patterns over time.

  Figma: [View Design](https://www.figma.com/design/U9C7We4dsxgUAyPJlQq3Xv/Dashboard-and-Meal-Tracker).

  ## Features
  | Feature | Description |
  |---------|-------------|
  | Dashboard Overview | Summary of recent health checks |
  |---------|-------------|
  | Prenatal Hub | Summary of pregnancy vitals and trackers |
  |---------|-------------|
  | Meal Tracker | Holistic nutrition hub to track daily and weekly food intake. |
  |---------|-------------|
  | Resources | Dashboard of local resources and patient advocacy tools |
  |---------|-------------|
  | Export Report | Download an overall health report to bring to your next health service. |
  |---------|-------------|

  ## Running the code

  Requirements:
  - [Node.js]([url](http://nodejs.org/en/download))

  Run `npm i` to install the dependencies.

  Run `npm run dev` to start the development server.
  
